  "body": "Steps to reproduce:\r\n1. Run [create navigation params by fetching](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#create-navigation-params-by-fetching) to populate _active_ session history entry\r\n2. On the first iteration through \"while true\" loop (step 19), change the *active's* entry document state to new document state (step 19.19)\r\n3. Go to the second iteration through \"while true\" loop (step 19) to \"process the next manual redirect\"\r\n4. The fetch queues a task (step 4 of [fetch response handover](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#fetch-finale)) to process a response that could never finish because the document used as the fetch's task destination is no longer active (because active's entry document state changed to newly created document state).\r\n\r\nRelated, but a different bug: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9869\r\n\r\ncc @domenic \r\n",
